 "remarks": "Discover the charm of this beautifully maintained, detached Colonial-style condominium in Stamford's desirable Glen Arthur Estates community. Offering the privacy and feel of a single family home with the convenience of condominium living, this inviting residence features bright, sun-filled interiors, striking Palladian windows, and newly installed hardwood floors and fresh interior paint, both completed in August 2026. The welcoming eat-in kitchen features a vaulted ceiling and skylight, creating an airy, light-filled space. Upstairs, three comfortable bedrooms and two full bathrooms provide ample room for everyday living, while the finished lower level offers exceptional flexibility for a family room, home office, recreation space, or guest accommodations.  Outside, a private patio and beautifully landscaped garden setting create a peaceful retreat for relaxing, entertaining, or dining outdoors. Ideally situated in Stamford's Glenbrook neighborhood, this home offers convenient access to shopping, dining, and public transportation, including the Glenbrook train station within walking distance. Easy access to I-95 and the Merritt Parkway makes commuting a breeze. A wonderful opportunity to enjoy the space and privacy of a detached home, the ease of condominium living, and the convenience of one of Stamford's most accessible neighborhoods.",
